<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-PILTEL FIRST HALF NET INCOME LOWER.</title>
<headline>TABLE-PILTEL FIRST HALF NET INCOME LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			(in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			   165.8 vs   487.6</p>
<p>    Operating Revenues	     2,572.0 vs 2,440.8</p>
<p>    Fully diluted EPS (pesos)	 0.12 vs 0.44</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Pilipino Telephone Corp. The cellular phone company said its unaudited second quarter net income reached 112.4 million pesos against 241 million a year ago.</p>
